  "keyFeatures": [
    "Markerless pose estimation for any animal or object using deep learning",
    "Single-animal and multi-animal tracking support",
    "PyTorch and TensorFlow backends (PyTorch recommended)",
    "SuperAnimal pretrained foundation models via Model Zoo",
    "Multiple model architectures: ResNet, HRNet, RTMPose, BUCTD, DLCRNet",
    "GUI (napari-based) and Python API interfaces",
    "3D pose estimation with stereo camera support",
    "Active learning and frame extraction for efficient labeling",
    "Real-time inference via DLClive",
    "Multi-animal re-identification and tracklet stitching"
  ],
